	(text "LS3 Low-side rev P\nQ5-Q7 stay NCE4080K TO-252 (LCSC C191380) on microcore-fp:DPAK\n12 ohm gate; US1M flyback (C112545) + SMAJ33A (C143131); no series ballast\nDiscrete MOSFET, not a protected smart FET. No gate driver. No premium clamps.\nRDS(on) < 7 mohm at Vgs=10 V, ID=20 A. No RDS(on) row at 4.5 V or 2.5 V.\nVth 1.2/1.8/2.5 V. MCU gate is 3.3 V, so the FET turns on but is not at the 10 V RDS(on) spec."
		(at 120 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a70048f9-6b4f-4ccb-a99d-1ee5ef8fad46")
	)
